    "affected_api": "sklearn.linear_model.RidgeCV",
    "observed_behavior": "When fitting with RidgeCV using gcv_mode=\"svd\" and very small alphas, the fitted coefficients become extremely large in magnitude, leading to a catastrophic (very negative) test score instead of an almost perfect fit.",
